# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Admin/mobile sources stay out; their manifests are re-included because
# bun install --frozen-lockfile validates every workspace package.json.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env*
apps/admin
apps/mobile
!apps/admin/package.json
!apps/mobile/package.json
supabase
docs
.claude
.grilled
*.md
